surface":"ஊர","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"vocative suffix"}],"gloss":"O lord of the town"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நின்","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பாணன்","parts":[{"text":"பாணன்","lemma":"பாணன்","gloss":"bard"}],"gloss":"bard"},{"surface":"பொய்யன்","parts":[{"text":"பொய்","lemma":"பொய்","gloss":"lie"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"masculine singular suffix"}],"gloss":"liar"},{"surface":"ஆக","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"being"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உள்ள","parts":[{"text":"உள்","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"exist"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"existing"},{"surface":"பாணர்","parts":[{"text":"பாணர்","lemma":"பாணர்","gloss":"bards"}],"gloss":"bards"},{"surface":"எல்லாம்","parts":[{"text":"எல்லாம்","lemma":"எல்லாம்","gloss":"all"}],"gloss":"all"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கள்வர்","parts":[{"text":"கள்வர்","lemma":"கள்வர்","gloss":"thieves"}],"gloss":"thieves"},{"surface":"போல்வர்","parts":[{"text":"போல்","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"resemble"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"future marker"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"third person plural suffix"}],"gloss":"resemble"},{"surface":"நீ","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you"},{"surface":"அகன்றிசினோர்க்கே","parts":[{"text":"அகன்றிசினோர்க்கே","lemma":"அகன்றிசினோர்க்கே","gloss":"to those whom you have left"}],"gloss":"to those whom you have left","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"A heron to catch dived, the carp fish nearby / fear-possessing lotus's white bud fears / paddy field's beautiful garden's Kāñci tree town's lord! / Just one, your bard, a liar being, / existing bards all / thieves resemble, to those whom you have left!","translation":"O lord of the town of Kāñci trees, with beautiful gardens near paddy fields, where a carp fish, diving to escape a hunting heron, trembles in fear near a bright lotus bud! Because that one bard of yours has become a liar, all other bards now seem like thieves to those whom you have abandoned.","modern":"வயல்வெளிகளைச் சார்ந்த அழகிய தோட்டங்களில் காஞ்சி மரங்கள் நிறைந்த ஊரின் தலைவனே! கொக்கு தன்னை இரையாகக் கொள்ளுமாறு மூழ்கிய கெண்டை மீன், அருகில் உள்ள அச்சம் தரும் தாமரையின் வெண்மையான மொட்டைக் கண்டு அஞ்சும் ஊரை உடையவனே! உன்னுடைய ஒரு பாணன் பொய்யனாக இருப்பதனால், உன்னைப் பிரிந்து வாழும் எங்களுக்கு, உலகில் உள்ள பாணர்கள் எல்லாரும் திருடர்களைப் போலவே தோன்றுகின்றனர்.","explanation":"This poem is set in the Marutam landscape (agricultural tract) and is spoken by the heroine's friend (tōḻi) to the hero who has returned from his tryst with courtesans. The hero has sent his bard as a messenger to plead his case, but the bard lied about the hero's behavior. The friend uses an implicit metaphor (uḷḷuṟai): the carp fish, having dived to escape the predatory heron, now trembles in fear even at the sight of a harmless white lotus bud, mistaking it for the heron. Similarly, the heroine, having been deeply hurt by the hero's infidelity, now distrusts all bards, viewing them as thieves and liars because of the one deceptive bard. This imagery beautifully captures the deep sense of betrayal and the loss of trust in the household.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,2.6],[2.6,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.5,3.91],[3.97,4.1],[4.1,5.8],[5.8,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,7.3],[7.3,7.6],[7.6,8.1],[8.1,8.3],[8.3,9.1],[9.3,9.7],[9.7,10.1],[10.1,10.71],[10.71,11.47],[11.47,12.23],[12.3,12.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.7],[1.7,3.0],[3.0,3.6],[3.6,4.2],[4.2,4.77],[4.77,5.49],[5.49,6.2],[6.2,6.4],[6.55,6.7],[6.7,7.7],[7.7,8.0],[8.0,8.5],[8.5,8.9],[8.9,9.51],[9.74,10.2],[10.2,10.5],[10.5,11.4],[11.4,12.0],[12.0,12.66],[12.74,13.3]]},"sync":[[["குருகு","heron"],["கொள","to catch"]],[["குளித்த","dived"]],[["கெண்டை","carp fish"]],[["அயலது","of the neighborhood"]],[["உரு","fear"],["கெழு","possessing"]],[["தாமரை","lotus"]],[["வான்","white"],["முகை","bud"]],[["வெரூஉம்","fears"]],[["கழனி","paddy field"],["அம்","beautiful"]],[["படப்பை","garden"],["காஞ்சி","Kāñci tree"]],[["காஞ்சி","Kāñci tree"]],[["ஊர","O lord of the town"]],[["ஒரு","one"],["நின்","your"]],[["பாணன்","bard"]],[["பொய்யன்","liar"]],[["பொய்யன்","liar"],["ஆக","being"]],[["உள்ள","existing"]],[["பாணர்","bards"]],[["எல்லாம்","all"]],[["கள்வர்","thieves"]],[["போல்வர்","resemble"],["நீ","you"]],[["அகன்றிசினோர்க்கே","to those whom you have left"]],[["அகன்றிசினோர்க்கே","to those whom you have left"]]]}